blurb = "Like the rest of the series, this print depicts famous theatrical characters comically reimagined at a market.

Shamo (軍鶏) is a strange-looking breed of Japanese game fowl originally brought from Thailand for cockfighting. It was apparently eaten, cooked in a hotpot dish, during the Edo period."
